    {"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":330001,"isDeleted":false,"id":"bad-math","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":620,"y":340,"strokeColor":"#b91c1c","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":500,"height":110,"seed":3300,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1715472000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"text":"If model identical:\n  errors correlate ~0.7-0.9\n  effective independent reviewers ≈ 1\n  confidence collapses to ~85-90%\n\nReal-world failure mode:\n  3 Claude instances overconfident about LoopZero\n  All score 4.0; reviewer dismisses dim 3.5 truth.\n\nWhy ADR D1 caps 95-97% (not 99%):\n  Even with 3 models varied, training-data overlap\n  produces residual ~0.1-0.2 correlation. Honest cap.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":11,"containerId":null,"originalText":"If model identical:\n  errors correlate ~0.7-0.9\n  effective independent reviewers ≈ 1\n  confidence collapses to ~85-90%\n\nReal-world failure mode:\n  3 Claude instances overconfident about LoopZero\n  All score 4.0; reviewer dismisses dim 3.5 truth.\n\nWhy ADR D1 caps 95-97% (not 99%):\n  Even with 3 models varied, training-data overlap\n  produces residual ~0.1-0.2 correlation. Honest cap."},

    {"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":400001,"isDeleted":false,"id":"footer","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":40,"y":620,"strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":1100,"height":80,"seed":4000,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1715472000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":13,"fontFamily":1,"text":"Validation: `bash infra/scripts/governance/verify-independence.sh` reads docs/governance/personas/independence-config.yaml,\nverifies ≥2 of 3 dimensions varied. Exit 1 if violated.\n\nCross-vendor: P2 uses codex-rescue (gpt-5-4) for maximum diversity. Fallback: if codex unavailable, all 3 stay Claude family\nbut temp/seed dimensions remain distinct — confidence cap downgrades to 90-95%.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":11,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Validation: `bash infra/scripts/governance/verify-independence.sh` reads docs/governance/personas/independence-config.yaml,\nverifies ≥2 of 3 dimensions varied. Exit 1 if violated.\n\nCross-vendor: P2 uses codex-rescue (gpt-5-4) for maximum diversity. Fallback: if codex unavailable, all 3 stay Claude family\nbut temp/seed dimensions remain distinct — confidence cap downgrades to 90-95%."}
  ],
